flowchart LR
    subgraph Training Pipeline
        BASE[Pre-trained Base Model] --> TRAIN[Fine-tuning Job - LoRA/QLoRA]
        DS[(Labeled Dataset - instruction/response pairs)] --> TRAIN
        TRAIN --> ADAPTER[Fine-tuned Adapter or merged model weights]
    end

    subgraph Serving
        ADAPTER --> DEPLOY[Model Server - Ollama / vLLM / TGI]
        REQ[User Request] --> DEPLOY
        DEPLOY --> RESP[Specialized Response]
    end
